Package: admetshiny
Type: Package
Title: Interactive ADMET and Drug-Likeness Analysis of Small Molecules
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-25-07
Authors@R: person("Xavier Clemente", "Garcia Cevallos", email = "xgarcia@unicauca.edu.co", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3284-2363"))
Maintainer: Xavier Clemente Garcia Cevallos <xgarcia@unicauca.edu.co>
Description: An open-source R package with a Shiny interface and codebased tools designed to calculate molecular descriptors, harmonize heterogeneous ADMET datasets from external web servers or local sources, apply drug-likeness filters, predict pharmacokinetic properties such as P-glycoprotein substrates and BOILED-Egg parameters, and generate publication-ready visualizations and automated analysis reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/xavierclementegarcia/admetshiny
